---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import ReviewWindow from '../../components/ReviewWindow.astro';
---
<Page
  title="Review queue"
  description="Every conclusion ArborSpace reaches arrives as a finding in a review queue, where an expert approves or rejects it."
  eyebrow="Product · Review queue"
  heading="People decide."
  lead="Every conclusion arrives as a finding in a review queue. The expert approves or rejects it, and that decision feeds the memory."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>A finding, in context</h2>
        <p>
          A finding never arrives alone. It comes linked to the asset, the site, the engagement
          and the stakeholder concerned, along with the rule that produced it.
        </p>
        <h2>Decisions that build the memory</h2>
        <p>
          Approving or rejecting a finding is not lost work: each decision is kept, and enriches
          the firm’s memory for the next case.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ReviewWindow />
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>
